  "description": "JSInterop of StreamSaver (https://github.com/jimmywarting/StreamSaver.js) for Blazor.\nDownload files by writing incoming data chunks straight to the file instead of accumulating them in memory, which prevents memory overflows for very large files.\nIntended for Blazor WebAssembly. It also runs on Blazor Server, but every chunk crosses the SignalR circuit, so it is a poor fit for the large transfers this package exists for.",
  "iconFile": "me.png",
