  "published": "2026-09-07T20:00:21.627Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Modernised for .NET 10. Targets net10.0 only; net5.0 is no longer supported.\nThe JS interop is rebuilt on IJSObjectReference modules, replacing System.Private.Runtime.InteropServices.JavaScript — the .NET 5/6 preview WASM API that was removed in .NET 7 and that this package could not have run without.\nFixed: WriteAsync ignored the offset and count it was given and sent the whole array. Stream.WriteAsync(ReadOnlyMemory) supplies an oversized pooled buffer, so downloads had trailing bytes appended.",
